00:00:15.286 --> 00:00:16.119
that you ran into each other,

00:00:16.119 --> 00:00:17.160
and you're like, "I'll see you
in a few days." (chuckling)

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:18.908
- It's kind of like a campus,

00:00:18.908 --> 00:00:20.550
it's getting smaller
and smaller and smaller.

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:21.810
- I like it.
- The more we go closer

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:23.490
